OL,3,GNEWSADippers brave freezing
OL,4,Atemperatures for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 70 people have braved the
OL,7,Fcold water at a surfing lake to raise
OL,8,Fmoney for a hospice.
OL,10,FThe Wave in Bristol hosted the
OL,11,Ffundraising event on Saturday, for the
OL,12,FSt Peter's Hospice which provides care
OL,13,Fto patients in Bristol, South
OL,14,FGloucestershire and North Somerset.
OL,16,FSupporter John Morris, from Bradley
OL,17,FStoke, took part in last year's event
OL,18,Fas a way to give something back to the
OL,19,Fhospice team who cared for his mum Ivy
OL,20,Fin the final weeks of her life.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
