OL,3,GNEWSADippers brave freezing
OL,4,Atemperatures for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorris said: "Swimming in the cold
OL,7,Fwater and meeting up with my new
OL,8,Fswimming friends was my way of dealing
OL,9,Fwith the stress of everything."
